      "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Macedonian\">Macedonian</h2></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etymology\">Etymology</h3></div>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#inherited\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">Inherited</a> from <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Proto-Slavic_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Proto-Slavic language\">Proto-Slavic</a></span> <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"sla-pro\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reconstruction:Proto-Slavic/d%D1%8Al%C5%BE%D1%8Cn%D1%8A\" title=\"Reconstruction:Proto-Slavic/dъlžьnъ\">&#42;dъlžьnъ</a></i>. Cognate with <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bulgarian_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Bulgarian language\">Bulgarian</a></span> <i class=\"Cyrl mention\" lang=\"bg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%D0%B4%D0%BB%D1%8A%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD#Bulgarian\" title=\"длъжен\">длъ́жен</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span lang=\"bg-Latn\" class=\"mention-tr tr Latn\">dlắžen</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span> and <span class=\"etyl\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Russian_language\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Russian language\">Russian</a></span> <i class=\"Cyrl mention\" lang=\"ru\"><a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Russian\">до́лжен</a></i> <span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">(</span><span lang=\"ru-Latn\" class=\"mention-tr tr Latn\">dólžen</span><span class=\"mention-gloss-paren annotation-paren\">)</span>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Pronunciation\">Pronunciation</h3></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wiktionary:International_Phonetic_Alphabet\" title=\"Wiktionary:International Phonetic Alphabet\">IPA</a><sup>(<a href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Macedonian_pronunciation\" title=\"Appendix:Macedonian pronunciation\">key</a>)</sup>